{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"n-batch","type":"text","x":380,"y":560,"width":300,"height":135,"color":"4","text":"**④ RecSignalBatch.run()**\n→ RecSignalService.runBatch() 진입\n📁 `RecSignalBatch.java`"},
		{"id":"n-universe","type":"text","x":380,"y":730,"width":300,"height":105,"color":"4","text":"**⑤ `resolveMarketUniverse()`**\nTB_STK_MASTER 전 종목 조회\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-basedt","type":"text","x":380,"y":870,"width":300,"height":105,"color":"4","text":"**⑥ `resolveEffectiveBaseDate()`**\n영업일 캘린더 → 실제 가격 존재일\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-target","type":"text","x":380,"y":1010,"width":300,"height":105,"color":"4","text":"**⑦ `resolveTargetStockList()`**\nretry-only 파라미터 처리\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-fetch","type":"text","x":380,"y":1150,"width":300,"height":125,"color":"3","text":"**⑧ `fetchAdjustedDailyPrices()`**\nKIS OpenAPI → 수정주가\n최대 240일치 일봉 수집\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-build","type":"text","x":380,"y":1310,"width":300,"height":155,"color":"3","text":"**⑨ `buildRecSignal()`**\n지표 계산 메인 메서드\nnull 반환 시 → **EXCLUDED**\n(가격·MA 데이터 부족)\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-ma","type":"text","x":380,"y":1480,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"**⑩ `calculateMaResult()`**\nMA5 / MA20 / MA60\nMA120 / MA240\n최근 유효 close 240개 기반\n📁 `MaCalculateService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-recyn","type":"text","x":380,"y":1650,"width":300,"height":215,"color":"1","text":"**⑪ `resolveRecYn()`**\nGOLDEN_YN == \"Y\"\nAND MON_UP_YN == \"Y\"\n→ REC_YN = **Y**\nelse → REC_YN = **N**\n⚡ 조건 2개 · if-else 분기\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:654`"},
		{"id":"n-golden","type":"text","x":-320,"y":1415,"width":320,"height":115,"text":"**GOLDEN_YN** — `isGoldenArray()`\nMA 정배열 여부\n📁 `MaCalculateService.java:60`"},
		{"id":"n-monup","type":"text","x":-320,"y":1545,"width":320,"height":115,"text":"**MON_UP_YN** — `isMonthUp()`\ncurPrice > monOpenPrice\n📁 `MaCalculateService.java:68`"},
		{"id":"n-chgrate","type":"text","x":-320,"y":1675,"width":320,"height":115,"text":"**MON_CHG_RATE** — `calculateMonthChangeRate()`\n월간 등락률 (%)\n📁 `MaCalculateService.java:74`"},
		{"id":"n-trend","type":"text","x":-320,"y":1808,"width":320,"height":115,"text":"**TREND_STRENGTH** — `calculateTrendStrength()`\n정배열 구간 수 (0~5)\n📁 `MaCalculateService.java:81`"},
		{"id":"n-trdval","type":"text","x":-320,"y":1940,"width":320,"height":115,"text":"**AVG_TRD_VAL_20** — `calculateAvgTradeValue20()`\n20일 평균 거래대금\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:630`"},
		{"id":"n-grade-a","type":"text","x":880,"y":1865,"width":280,"height":115,"color":"3","text":"**A등급 🏆**\ncurPrice > MA5\nmonChgRate ≥ 3.0% 강한 모멘텀\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:661`"},
		{"id":"n-grade-b","type":"text","x":880,"y":1990,"width":280,"height":115,"text":"**B등급 📊**\ncurPrice > MA5\n0% < monChgRate < 3.0%\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:661`"},
		{"id":"n-grade-c","type":"text","x":880,"y":2115,"width":280,"height":115,"text":"**C등급 📋**\ncurPrice ≤ MA5\nGOLDEN=Y 이지만 역설 주의\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:661`"},
		{"id":"n-buy","type":"text","x":-240,"y":3135,"width":280,"height":125,"text":"**`registerBuy()`**\nWATCH → BOUGHT\nFIRST_BUY_DATE / PRICE / QTY\n📁 `RecPickController.java`\n📁 `RecPickService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-exec-log","type":"text","x":-320,"y":2200,"width":320,"height":110,"text":"**TB_BATCH_EXEC_LOG**\n배치 전체 결과 · TOTAL/SUCCESS/FAIL/EXCLUDED\n🗄 `StockBatchAdminMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-item-log","type":"text","x":-320,"y":2413,"width":320,"height":105,"text":"**TB_BATCH_EXEC_ITEM_LOG**\n종목별 STATUS · 에러 메시지\n🗄 `StockBatchAdminMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-filter","type":"text","x":-320,"y":2605,"width":320,"height":105,"text":"🔍 **필터 패널**\n시장 / 등급 / 기준일 / TREND 슬라이더\n📁 `recSignalList.js`"},
		{"id":"n-chart-ui","type":"text","x":-320,"y":2735,"width":320,"height":110,"text":"📈 **Highcharts 차트**\n일봉 + MA 라인 · 골든크로스 flag\n📁 `recSignalChartOptions.js`"},
		{"id":"n-merge","type":"text","x":380,"y":2210,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"**⑬ `mergeRecSignal()`**\nMERGE INTO TB_REC_SIGNAL\nPK: BASE_DT + MKT_CD + STK_CD\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`\n🗄 `RecSignalMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-signal-db","type":"text","x":380,"y":2390,"width":300,"height":310,"color":"5","text":"**⑭ TB_REC_SIGNAL**\nMA5 / MA20 / MA60 / MA120 / MA240\nGOLDEN_YN / MON_UP_YN\nMON_CHG_RATE / TREND_STRENGTH\nAVG_TRD_VAL_20\n**REC_YN / REC_GRADE / REC_REASON**\nINDEX: BASE_DT + MKT_CD + REC_YN\n🗄 `RecSignalMapper.xml`\n🗄 `db/DDL_TB_REC_SIGNAL.sql`"},
		{"id":"n-recgrade","type":"text","x":380,"y":1890,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**⑫ `resolveRecGrade()`** (if-else)\nprice > MA5 && rate ≥ 3.0% → **\"A\"**\nprice > MA5 && 0 < rate < 3% → **\"B\"**\nprice ≤ MA5 (나머지) → **\"C\"**\nREC_YN = N → **null**\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:661`"},
		{"id":"n-excluded","type":"text","x":880,"y":1310,"width":280,"height":145,"text":"**EXCLUDED**\nbuildRecSignal() → null\n데이터 부족 · DB 미저장\n← 추적·평가 배제\n📁 `RecSignalService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-sched-job","type":"text","x":-320,"y":315,"width":320,"height":140,"text":"**TB_STK_BATCH_JOB_RUNTIME**\nRUNNING_YN / LOCK_OWNER\nLAST_HEARTBEAT_AT\nSTOP_REQUEST_YN\n🗄 `StockBatchAdminMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":-320,"y":-280,"width":1390,"height":50,"color":"3","text":"⬇️ 배치 실행 로직 — 위에서 아래 순서도  |  @Scheduled → triggerJob → buildRecSignal → resolveRecYn → resolveRecGrade → TB_REC_SIGNAL → 픽 등록 → 추적 → 평가"},
		{"id":"h-center","type":"text","x":380,"y":-220,"width":300,"height":30,"color":"3","text":"⚙️ 핵심 실행 로직 (순서대로)"},
		{"id":"h-right","type":"text","x":780,"y":-220,"width":280,"height":30,"text":"🔀 분기 / 출력"},
		{"id":"n-l1","type":"text","x":380,"y":-165,"width":300,"height":145,"color":"5","text":"**① @Scheduled(fixedDelay=60000)**\n`StockBatchAdminController`\n`.stockBatchAdminTick()`\n매 **60초** 고정 delay · 스레드 풀 8개\n📁 `StockBatchAdminController.java`"},
		{"id":"n-l2","type":"text","x":380,"y":28,"width":300,"height":195,"color":"5","text":"**② `schedulerTick()`**\n`selectDueJobs` 쿼리 실행\n- ENABLED_YN = Y\n- SCHEDULE_ENABLED_YN = Y\n- **NEXT_RUN_AT ≤ SYSDATE**\n📁 `StockBatchAdminService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-l3","type":"text","x":380,"y":280,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"5","text":"**③ `triggerJob()`**\ndaemon thread 생성\n`tryAcquireRuntimeLock` (SINGLETON)\nheartbeat 갱신 · MAX_RUNTIME_SEC 감시\n📁 `StockBatchAdminService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-cron","type":"text","x":-320,"y":63,"width":320,"height":150,"text":"**TB_STK_BATCH_JOB_SCHEDULE**\nSCHEDULE_TYPE = CRON\n`0 30 3 ? * TUE,WED,THU,FRI,SAT`\nMISFIRE = SKIP\n🗄 `StockBatchAdminMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"h-left","type":"text","x":-320,"y":-220,"width":280,"height":30,"color":"5","text":"📥 입력 / DB"},
		{"id":"n-recyn-n","type":"text","x":880,"y":1698,"width":280,"height":120,"text":"**REC_YN = N**\n조건 미충족 → DB 저장됨\nEXCLUDED와 구분 필요\n📁 `RecSignalService.java:654`"},
		{"id":"n-pick-db","type":"text","x":380,"y":3390,"width":300,"height":155,"color":"6","text":"**⑰ TB_S_RECO_PICK**\nPICK_STATUS: WATCH→BOUGHT→CLOSED\nENTRY_RULE_CODE\n`ruleTargetPrice()` · `ruleStopPrice()`\n📁 `RecPickService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-daily-batch","type":"text","x":380,"y":3670,"width":300,"height":135,"color":"6","text":"**⑱ `RecPickDailyBatch.run()`**\n→ `runDailyTrack()` (RecPickTrackService)\n매일 WATCH/BOUGHT 전체 추적\n📁 `RecPickDailyBatch.java`"},
		{"id":"n-daily-db","type":"text","x":380,"y":3825,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"6","text":"**⑲ TB_S_RECO_PICK_DAILY**\nRETURN_*_PCT · MFE · MAE\nTP1_HIT_YN / STOP_HIT_YN\nSELL_SIGNAL_CODE\n🗄 `RecPickTrackMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-prob","type":"text","x":380,"y":3995,"width":300,"height":115,"color":"6","text":"**⑳ `RecProbabilityService`**\n`selectProbability()` — 등급별 승률 조회\n5 / 10 / 20 / 60일 구간 평가\n📁 `RecProbabilityService.java`"},
		{"id":"n-eval-db","type":"text","x":380,"y":4145,"width":300,"height":115,"color":"6","text":"**㉑ TB_S_RECO_PICK_EVAL**\nHOLD_DAYS / WIN_YN\nRETURN_PCT / CALC_STATUS\n🗄 `RecProbabilityMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-stats","type":"text","x":380,"y":4295,"width":300,"height":145,"color":"6","text":"**㉒ VW_S_RECO_PICK_STATS**\n`selectProbabilityStats()`\n등급별 승률 / MFE / MAE 집계\n→ ♻️ resolveRecGrade 피드백 루프\n🗄 `db/DDL_VW_S_RECO_PICK_STATS.sql`"},
		{"id":"n-save","type":"text","x":380,"y":3045,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"6","text":"**⑯ `saveToWatchlist()`**\nPICK_STATUS = WATCH\nSNAPSHOT_JSON (당시 MA 저장)\n📁 `RecPickController.java`"},
		{"id":"n-screen","type":"text","x":380,"y":2765,"width":300,"height":165,"text":"**⑮ 선별 화면 UI**\n`selectRecSignalList()` — list.do\n필터 패널 · 종목 리스트\n상세 Highcharts 차트 · ★ 픽 등록\n📁 `recSignalList.jsp`\n📁 `RecSignalController.java`"},
		{"id":"n-dlyprice","type":"text","x":-320,"y":1150,"width":320,"height":125,"text":"**TB_STK_DLY_PRICE**\n일봉 (수정주가)\n기준일봉 참조\n🗄 `FinanceMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-calendar","type":"text","x":-320,"y":870,"width":320,"height":105,"text":"**TB_TRADE_CALENDAR**\n영업일 기준 · KR / US\n🗄 `FinanceMapper.xml`"},
		{"id":"n-master","type":"text","x":-320,"y":730,"width":320,"height":105,"text":"**TB_STK_MASTER**\nUSE_YN=Y + STK_STATUS=NORMAL\n🗄 `FinanceMapper.xml`"}
	],
